  "behavior_violation": true,
  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the provided reference by asserting that EU citizens can use their foreign driving licence without any time limit or exam, whereas the reference clearly states that a foreign licence is valid for only 12 months from entry date and holders from non-ASTRA countries must pass a control drive.",
  "evidence": "Il permiss stranier è valaivel per ina durada illimitada, ma cun la restricziun ch’il domicil principal sto esser en Svizra e ch’ins na poss betg manischar en l’auter pajais da provenienza cun quest permiss svizzer."
